title: Enchanter
---
<<declare $metEnchanter = false>>
<<if not $metEnchanter>>
    Enchanter: Ah, a new face. I give new life to what others discard.
    <<set $metEnchanter = true>>
<<endif>>

<<if npc_quest_state() == "none">>
    <<jump EnchanterOffer>>
<<elseif npc_quest_state() == "readytoclaim">>
    <<jump EnchanterQuestReady>>
<<elseif npc_quest_state() == "complete">>
    <<jump EnchanterQuestComplete>>
<<else>>
    <<jump EnchanterQuestActive>>
<<endif>>
===

title: EnchanterQuestReady
---
Enchanter: You're back! And with what I asked for. Splendid work.
<<if hero_has_line("enchanter.ready_reply")>>
    Player: {hero_line("enchanter.ready_reply", "")}
<<endif>>
Enchanter: You've earned this.
<<claim_reward>>
===

title: EnchanterOffer
---
Enchanter: I have work for you, if you're brave enough.
-> {hero_line("enchanter.accept", "I'll do it")} #accept
    <<start_quest>>
    Player: {hero_line("enchanter.accepted", "Consider it done.")}
    Enchanter: Good. Mind the dark places.
-> {hero_line("enchanter.trade", "Let's trade")}
    <<open_shop>>
-> {hero_line("enchanter.decline", "Not now")} #decline
    Player: {hero_line("enchanter.declined", "Not yet.")}
===

title: EnchanterQuestActive
---
Enchanter: The task is still yours. Do not keep me waiting.
-> {hero_line("enchanter.trade", "Let's trade")}
    <<open_shop>>
-> {hero_line("enchanter.decline", "Not now")} #decline
    <<if hero_has_line("enchanter.active_reply")>>
        Player: {hero_line("enchanter.active_reply", "")}
    <<endif>>
    Enchanter: Search the ruins north of town. What you need is buried deep.
===

title: EnchanterQuestComplete
---
Enchanter: You've done well. I have nothing more for you, for now.
-> {hero_line("enchanter.trade", "Let's trade")}
    <<open_shop>>
-> {hero_line("enchanter.decline", "Not now")} #decline
    <<if hero_has_line("enchanter.complete_reply")>>
        Player: {hero_line("enchanter.complete_reply", "")}
    <<endif>>
    Enchanter: Come back when you need my skills.
===